1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,072
First, isochoric: constant volume.

2
00:00:03,072 --> 00:00:06,953
Clamp the piston so it cannot move, and heat the gas.

3
00:00:06,953 --> 00:00:12,018
The volume stays fixed, so d V is zero and no work is done.

4
00:00:12,018 --> 00:00:14,921
All the heat goes into internal energy.

5
00:00:14,921 --> 00:00:16,757
Q equals delta U.

6
00:00:16,757 --> 00:00:19,088
On the graph, a vertical line.

